1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,552
Before you hit buy on that thing in your cart, try the twenty four hour rule.

2
00:00:04,902 --> 00:00:10,152
Countdown timers, only two left, flash sales. They are built to make you decide fast.

3
00:00:10,502 --> 00:00:14,043
So wait a full day before buying anything you didn't plan for.

4
00:00:14,393 --> 00:00:19,135
Often, by tomorrow, the urge has faded, and you can't remember why you wanted it.

5
00:00:19,485 --> 00:00:23,681
Still want it after a day, and it fits your budget? Then buy it, guilt free.

6
00:00:24,031 --> 00:00:26,665
For bigger purchases, stretch it to thirty days.

7
00:00:27,015 --> 00:00:30,691
One tiny pause, and a lot fewer things you regret buying.
